WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:06.179
Here's how to put the questions in a PollSlide deck in the order you want to ask them, and keep every QR code working.

2
00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:10.469
Open your deck, click a question, then click Edit this question.

3
00:00:13.523 --> 00:00:16.902
While you're editing, drag a question in the list to its new place.

4
00:00:16.902 --> 00:00:18.465
The list updates straight away.

5
00:00:20.157 --> 00:00:23.233
Or use the Up and Down buttons at the bottom of the editor.

6
00:00:23.233 --> 00:00:24.797
Each click moves it one place.

7
00:00:25.748 --> 00:00:32.835
Each question keeps its QR code and link when you move it, so codes already on your slides and handouts still open the same question.

8
00:00:32.835 --> 00:00:35.020
Its number changes to show its new place.

9
00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:37.574
Answers stay with their question.

10
00:00:37.574 --> 00:00:42.385
And if you move the question that's showing during a live session, your audience stays right on it.

11
00:00:43.336 --> 00:00:45.210
Your decks can have your order too.

12
00:00:45.210 --> 00:00:48.905
Choose My order in the sort menu, then drag them where you want them.

13
00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:52.888
That's it.

14
00:00:52.888 --> 00:00:56.320
Move questions whenever you like, and your codes keep working.

15
00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.863
The full guide is at pollslide dot com, slash reorder questions.
